  "_approach": "Kick-pickup build over the house frame: bar 1 keeps the night-bass bounce (kick/clap/offbeat open hat) while the closed-hat lattice thickens; bar 2 adds a driving kick pickup on the \"and\" of every beat, the clap flams into a double on beat 4, and the hats fill toward every 16th before a single silent 16th right before the drop. Ref: EDMProd's build-up guide (syncopated kick pickups plus hat-density lifts), Preset Drive's bass house guide on the genre's kick habits.",
